      "content": "Your symptoms of extreme thirst and frequent urination are classic signs of high blood sugar, which requires immediate medical attention from your doctor. While herbal supplements can sometimes contain hidden sugars or interact with medications, they are unlikely to be the sole cause of such sudden, severe symptoms. Please contact your healthcare provider today to get your blood glucose levels checked and to discuss your supplement use immediately. Do not wait, as managing uncontrolled diabetes is critical to your health.",
