      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "No, relying on Gatorade and resting at home is unsafe when experiencing severe symptoms like lightheadedness alongside classic diabetes signs. You could be in a hyperglycemic crisis where dehydration and high blood sugar can lead to dangerous, life-threatening complications like diabetic ketoacidosis. Please make time to see a healthcare professional today even amidst a busy work schedule; untreated high blood sugar puts you at serious risk for stroke or kidney damage.",
      "source": "target",
